    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Population Quiz</strong>, the ultimate test of your global knowledge! Do you have what it takes to guess which country or region has a larger population? Put your skills to the test in this fun and educational game that will challenge your understanding of the world's demographics. \ud83c\udf0e</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Mechanics: Each round presents you with two options \u2013 two countries or regions. Your task is to choose the one with the larger population. Sounds easy? Think again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enhance your geographical knowledge while having fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Interface: Enjoy a visually appealing and user-friendly interface that makes playing a breeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice soundtrack</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Are you ready</strong></i><strong> to test your knowledge and learn more about the world's population? </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >( \u0361\u00b0 \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0 )</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Population Quiz</strong>, the ultimate test of your global knowledge! Do you have what it takes to guess which country or region has a larger population? Put your skills to the test in this fun and educational game that will challenge your understanding of the world's demographics. \ud83c\udf0e</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Mechanics: Each round presents you with two options \u2013 two countries or regions. Your task is to choose the one with the larger population. Sounds easy? Think again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enhance your geographical knowledge while having fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Interface: Enjoy a visually appealing and user-friendly interface that makes playing a breeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nice soundtrack</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Are you ready</strong></i><strong> to test your knowledge and learn more about the world's population? </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >( \u0361\u00b0 \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0 )</h2>",
